# Research program map: connected layers, not one undifferentiated theory

The program has two genuinely connected mathematical branches and one empirical branch.

**Boolean operator branch.** CM representation -> signed operand-frame normalization -> safe fusion or fallback -> reversible Boolean-oracle synthesis. This branch supports arbitrary nonlinear Boolean functions on labels. Amplitude evolution of their reversible embedding is still linear. Paper B owns the operator and symbolic semantics; P02 imports oracle compilation only as background.

**Modal resource branch.** Cyclic coefficient order -> rotation commutant -> chosen A-valued linear dynamics -> explicitly chosen tensor/effect/preparation contracts -> contextuality and codebook classifications. The commutant step is derived. The operational choices after it are not. P01 owns the restricted-resource synthesis, including changes under enlarging the operation family.

**Symbolic interface.** Formula ring -> scalar extension -> valuation -> contraction -> nonzero-support formula. This interface can express the modal branch once its extra contracts have been chosen. It does not force the modal branch to be the semantics of bare LMs. P01 incorporates a short interface section and a proof supplement, citing Paper B for ordinary logical pairing.

**Empirical optimization branch.** Identical Boolean input DAG -> direct ANF / shared CSE / generic two-support / typed CM folding -> matched output -> compilation, memory and reuse accounting. This belongs with Paper B until natural matched benchmarks demonstrate an independently interesting result. It does not rely on Bell states, phases or contextuality.

## Claims that strengthen one another

The Smith trichotomy becomes more informative when paired with the d*h codebook theorem: the leading residue rank controls two different capabilities under the same measurement family, while full injectivity controls exact teleportation. The tensor and preparation counterexamples prevent the equivalence from being advertised as universal. This combination is stronger than a catalog of isolated examples.

The query lower bounds become clearer beside real A-module kickback and a singular character matrix. They show that reproducing one quantum-looking step is insufficient for an exact algorithm. UNIQUE-SAT demonstrates that the negative results do not condemn the whole modal computational model.

The compiler theorem becomes scientifically useful beside a comparator that reaches the same reduction. This shifts the question from rhetorical uniqueness to measurable recognition, memory, reuse and abstention costs. A well-characterized tie or loss is an informative result.

## Dependencies that must not be drawn

LM pairing does not imply nonzero-possible measurement. Rotation does not imply a tensor product. Nonseparability does not imply a selected support contradiction under every measurement restriction. Strong contextuality does not imply universal teleportation over rings. A small symbolic kernel does not imply a small materialized output. Exact modal codeword counts do not imply bits of Shannon capacity or a Born distribution.

